# Every .go and shell blob in this repo is stored with LF. Without these rules a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF working-tree files, and the
# gofmt step of `make ci` then fails on all of them for a reason that has nothing
# to do with the code (137 .go files, 90 reported issues, 2026-09-21).
*.go text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
